        "original_id": "d3cc9832-8c96-5aed-beef-cd9f0ea79fd3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jorge Salán, Jeff Scott Soto, Robin Beck, Fiona Flanagan, Bob Daisley\n- Organizations: Jeff Scott Soto Band, SOTO, Journey\n- Roles: lead guitar, singer, bass guitar player\n- Events: Robin Beck's European Tour 2013\n\nFacts:\n- Robin Beck was born on November 7, 1954, in Brooklyn, New York, and she is an American singer.\n- From 2009 to the present, Jorge Salán has been best known as the lead guitarist for solo singer Jeff Scott Soto and the Jeff Scott Soto Band, now called SOTO.\n- Jeff Scott Soto is identified here as the leading voice of Journey and Yngwie Malmsteen.\n- In 2013, Jorge Salán was the lead guitarist on Robin Beck's European Tour.\n- Jorge Salán has also collaborated with rock musicians including Fiona Flanagan and bass guitar player Bob Daisley.",
